  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Hydrating</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean at Sephora</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Vegan</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Full Coverage</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>A clean, comfortable, creamy lipstick that wraps lips in moisturizing mango seed oil, lip boosting peptides and high-impact color.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Formulation Type: </strong>Lipstick, Lip Liner</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Benefits: </strong>Hydrating</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Highlighted Ingredients: </strong></p><p>- Mango Seed Oil: Moisturizes and nourishes.</p><p>- Lip Boosting Peptides: Enhance natural volume.</p><p>- Hyaluronic Filling Spheres: Naturally plump and firm the look of lips and provide comfort and long-lasting hydration.</p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Twist up.<br>-Line lips with tip.<br>-Fill in with full-coverage color. <br>-Pout comfortably.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">-Mango Seed Oil: Moisturizes and nourishes.<br>-Lip Boosting Peptides: Enhance natural volume.<br>-Hyaluronic Filling Spheres: Naturally plump and firm the look of lips and provide comfort and long-lasting hydration.<br><br>Isododecane, Caprylyl Methicone, Synthetic Wax, Synthetic Fluorphlogopite, Diisostearyl Malate, Polybutene, Cetearyl Behenate, Silica, Ceramide Np, Palmitoyl Tripeptide-1, Sodium Hyaluronate, Tocopheryl Acetate, Mangifera Indica (Mango) Seed Oil, Ethylhexyl Palmitate, Sorbitan Isostearate, Silica Dimethyl Silylate, Butylene Glycol, Lactic Acid, Tribehenin, Caprylyl Glycol, Hexylene Glycol, Pentaerythrityl Tetra-Di-T-Butyl Hydroxyhydrocinnamate, Phenoxyethanol, Mica. May Contain/Peut Contenir: (+/-) Ci 77891 (Titanium Dioxide), Ci 15850 (Red 7), Ci 15850 (Red 7 Lake), Ci 42090 (Blue 1 Lake), Ci 15850 (Red 6), Ci 77491/77492/77499 (Iron Oxides).<br><br><i>The list of ingredients is subject to change, please consult the packaging of the product purchased.</i></div></details>",
